[[How close Auto Dodge and Autopilot cut past things. Low keeps a wide gap and reacts early, high squeezes through late.]],['Autopilot']=
[[Drives by itself and dodges on the way. With no destination it drives around: it keeps to the kind of road it is on, stays away from edges and water, and takes a turning now and then. Type a saved place below, or press Drive on a row in the Teleports tab while you sit in the driver's seat, and it drives there. Switch it off to take over.]]
